## Source anchors and proposed homes

Use the existing [Philosophy](../scholazein/philosophy/Philosophy.lingua), [Hephaestus](../ergon/hephaestus/Hephaestus.lingua), [Basic Eletronics](../ergon/hephaestus/computer-science/Basic%20Eletronics.lingua), [Farming](../ergon/gaia/farming/Farming.lingua), and [Supply](habits/simple/Supply.lingua) sources by reference. The [Trail Record](Lince.lingua#r_Q46Z5FZHZFACPNSNPJP2GEDC1D) remains the authority for Lince's general intention. Use existing identities and keep affected references valid when connecting or reorganising material.

