**Planning context:** [Chemistry](Trails.lingua#r_0AMZPCGB2MG2V6D28WFTQZN9Q6).
} r_22JVJTJ7A7PR682QABEE1X42CG

Engineering (@plan-engineering: 0, is #chapter, #planned, #part-of @plan-hephaestus, #contains @plan-engineering-design-and-systems-engineering, #contains @plan-civil-and-structural-engineering, #contains @plan-geotechnical-engineering, #contains @plan-construction-and-building-services-engineering, #contains @plan-water-and-environmental-engineering, #related "../ergon/hephaestus/engineering/mechanical-engineering-and-machine-design/Mechanical-engineering-and-machine-design.lingua#r_0017YZ63HZBZ4P4WD8DECVWE4R", #contains @plan-manufacturing-engineering, #related "../ergon/hephaestus/engineering/materials-engineering/Materials-engineering.lingua#r_05BF5JM8141RKF1VT5998YFZQ9", #contains @plan-corrosion-degradation-and-material-protection, #contains @plan-chemical-and-process-engineering, #contains @plan-thermal-and-energy-engineering, #contains @plan-refrigeration-cryogenics-and-cold-chains, #contains @plan-batteries-and-electrochemical-energy-systems, #contains @plan-control-and-automation-engineering, #contains @plan-mechatronics-and-robotics, #contains @plan-electronic-engineering, #contains @plan-telecommunications-and-radio-engineering, #contains @plan-optical-and-photonic-engineering, #contains @plan-computer-engineering-and-architecture, #contains @plan-acoustical-and-vibration-engineering, #contains @plan-aerospace-engineering, #contains @plan-marine-and-naval-engineering, #contains @plan-transportation-and-railway-engineering, #contains @plan-automotive-and-vehicle-engineering, #contains @plan-biomedical-engineering, #contains @plan-agricultural-engineering, #contains @plan-petroleum-and-subsurface-engineering, #contains @plan-nuclear-engineering, #contains @plan-industrial-engineering-and-production-systems, #contains @plan-reliability-maintenance-and-repair-systems, #contains @plan-human-factors-and-safety-engineering) { r_15X36BC9BQB5PV6WW77ZAAJP48
**Existing entrance:** [Engineering](../ergon/hephaestus/engineering/Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68).

**Content home:** `institute/trails/ergon/hephaestus/engineering/`, with subject directories for the planned pathways.

[Engineering — systems, design, construction, and operation](../ergon/hephaestus/engineering/Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68) connects the developed material through Ergon, Inquiry, Earth, and Philosophy.

**Pathways:** Compare designs against a need; understand a load-bearing part; diagnose a mechanism; investigate a selected process. Separate understanding, designing, making, inspecting, and maintaining routes. Geometry, CAD, mechanics, chemistry, electronics, and control belong where the chosen task uses them.

**Available:** [Mining and mineral engineering](../ergon/hephaestus/engineering/mining-and-mineral-engineering/Mining-and-mineral-engineering.lingua#r_22HJPS3RTK5EX1J55YJP75PHYA), from a material need, vocabulary, maps, and resource evidence through method/layout/sequence, ground, excavation/transport, utilities, mineral processing, products, waste, closure, and continuing work. Complete books, public university courses, government methods, original calculations, sustained practical/academic projects, integrated design, and independent scholarship provide depth. Eight shared learning Records retain distinct continuations.

**Available:** [Electrical power engineering](../ergon/hephaestus/engineering/electrical-power-engineering/Electrical-power-engineering.lingua#r_300EPNGATK7PHWNZCQFBXGZFCQ), from a useful electrical service, quantities and circuits through networks, transformers, machines, conversion, measurement, protection, stability, dispatch and continuing operation. Full technical books and public undergraduate/graduate programmes, three independently checked original calculations and twenty advanced investigations lead into an integrated system and independent research. Seventeen shared learning Records retain distinct power-engineering continuations.

**Available:** [Mechanical engineering and machine design — useful mechanisms and continuing service](../ergon/hephaestus/engineering/mechanical-engineering-and-machine-design/Mechanical-engineering-and-machine-design.lingua#r_0017YZ63HZBZ4P4WD8DECVWE4R) develops familiar machine observations into statics, dynamics, material behavior, machine elements, detailed manufacture, measurement, assembly and continuing service. Eleven shared quantitative, metrology and metallurgy Records retain their own routes. Four original programs, twelve advanced studies, an integrated machine investigation and independent research support demanding completion.

