**Available:** [Materials engineering — structure, processing and useful behavior](../ergon/hephaestus/engineering/materials-engineering/Materials-engineering.lingua#r_05BF5JM8141RKF1VT5998YFZQ9) develops composition, structure and evidence; equilibrium and transformations; material families and mechanical/functional response; processing, degradation, selection, service and recovery. Multiscale modeling, measurement inference and primary investigations lead into independent research with defense and revision. The route includes 351 authored Records, 72 shared learning Records, 24 advanced studies and seven original numerical programs, with discovery and relocated publication verified.

