Computing (@plan-computing: 0, is #chapter, #planned, #part-of @plan-hephaestus, #contains @plan-foundations-of-computer-science, #contains @plan-algorithms-and-data-structures, #contains @plan-programming-languages-and-implementation, #contains @plan-software-engineering-architecture-and-lifecycle, #contains @plan-operating-systems-and-systems-programming, #contains @plan-distributed-systems-and-cloud-computing, #contains @plan-databases-and-data-engineering, #contains @plan-computer-networks-and-internet-systems, #contains @plan-cybersecurity-and-privacy-engineering, #contains @plan-artificial-intelligence, #contains @plan-machine-learning-and-predictive-modelling, #contains @plan-language-and-speech-technology, #contains @plan-computer-vision-and-image-analysis, #contains @plan-computer-graphics-and-interactive-simulation, #contains @plan-humancomputer-interaction-and-accessibility, #contains @plan-scientific-computing-and-high-performance-computing, #contains @plan-embedded-and-real-time-systems, #contains @plan-semiconductor-devices-and-fabrication, #contains @plan-integrated-circuit-design-and-microelectronics, #contains @plan-signals-sensing-and-instrumentation-technology, #contains @plan-data-storage-and-archival-technology, #contains @plan-quantum-and-emerging-computing-technologies) { r_7YRTRPQ94D66X8Y7KN7K2XCTK8
**Existing entrance:** [Hephaestus](../ergon/hephaestus/Hephaestus.lingua#r_00000000000000000000002001).

**Content home:** `institute/trails/ergon/hephaestus/computer-science/`, with subject directories for the planned pathways.

Proposed branch Record: `@computing-map`. Organising Record: `@hephaestus`.

**Pathways:** Automate a small calculation; understand a program; investigate how a computer or network works; develop a maintained application. Programming, theoretical computation, digital hardware, data analysis, and operations have connected but different entry paths.

**Available foundations:** [Basic electronics](../ergon/hephaestus/computer-science/Basic%20Eletronics.lingua) develops circuits through connected embedded systems; [Reproducible computational work](../ergon/hephaestus/inquiry/reproducible-computation/Reproducible-computation.lingua#r_78FWWJDCV0ZGG7VYSPRCWN56DQ) develops programming and computational investigation. These can be reused while the broader computing subjects below are developed.

