} r_0CMC1K21QVZ8EHEKQJJ8RDP7J7

Resources and materials (@plan-resources-and-materials: 0, is #chapter, #planned, #part-of @plan-hephaestus, #contains @plan-mineral-resources-extraction-and-refining-systems, #contains @plan-ceramics-glass-cement-and-mineral-products, #contains @plan-polymers-rubber-composites-and-coatings-production, #contains @plan-machine-tools-and-precision-production-infrastructure, #contains @plan-textiles-clothing-and-technical-fabrics, #contains @plan-timber-paper-and-packaging-systems) { r_08Q5J1HMAA7S3QNYSJSQ49STJ5
**Existing entrance:** [Materials](../ergon/hephaestus/materials/Materials.lingua#r_14HP6K610XB12E2WGNK9A6VN8D).

**Content home:** `institute/trails/ergon/hephaestus/materials/`, with subject directories for the planned pathways.

[Resources and materials — feedstocks, useful properties, production, and recovery](../ergon/hephaestus/materials/Materials.lingua#r_14HP6K610XB12E2WGNK9A6VN8D) connects the developed material through Ergon, Engineering, Inquiry, Earth, and Philosophy.

**Pathways:** Follow one material from source through processing, specification, use, and recovery. Enter through the object or feedstock; link the particular geology, chemistry, properties, machines, and quantities needed at each depth.

**Available:** [Metals and metallurgical production](../ergon/hephaestus/materials/metals-and-metallurgical-production/Metals-and-metallurgical-production.lingua#r_59BDAQXT81552YF5F8TH4KQQH1), from familiar objects, feed, phases, quantities, and product requirements through extraction/refining, metal families, structure/transformations, manufacturing, testing, operation, recovery, and independent scholarship. Complete books, university and graduate courses, primary methods, original calculations, sustained laboratory/process studies, and an integrated material system provide depth. Thirteen shared learning Records retain distinct continuations.

**Available:** [Chemical feedstocks and supply systems](../ergon/hephaestus/materials/chemical-feedstocks-and-supply-systems/Chemical-feedstocks-and-supply-systems.lingua#r_05V6FYWMN0VND552CQE94HHA2Q), from familiar material, function/quantity/grade and origins through chemical families, supplier-to-user evidence, storage/contact and transfers, usable inventory, planning, continuity, people, maintenance and recovery. Complete books, graduate programmes, full technical/product methods, three independently checked calculations and fourteen sustained advanced investigations deepen into a complete defended system and independent research. Fourteen shared Records retain distinct chemical-supply continuations.

## Planned pathways

- [Mineral resources, extraction, and refining systems](Trails.lingua#r_1T654Z06ZJ9CA149M75XP0AF95)
