- [Timber, paper, and packaging systems](Trails.lingua#r_1EK7CM15ZR70X480KKR4F150KT)

**Planning context:** [Trails — Knowledge to learn and use](Trails.lingua#r_7A4AY51TXG87NVHR9J1XNZTJQ9).
} r_08Q5J1HMAA7S3QNYSJSQ49STJ5

