Energy and utilities (@plan-energy-and-utilities: 0, is #chapter, #planned, #part-of @plan-hephaestus, #contains @plan-electricity-infrastructure-and-energy-storage, #contains @plan-fuels-hydrogen-and-thermal-energy-supply) { r_376AMKFFG2BY4E8T2A5Y923HV4
**Existing entrance:** [Utilities](../ergon/hephaestus/utilities/Utilities.lingua#r_23Z5YYXGRA1JDFD4BAM955JMNX).

**Content home:** `institute/trails/ergon/hephaestus/utilities/`, with subject directories for the planned pathways.

Proposed branch Record: `@energy-utilities-map`. Organising Record: `@hephaestus`.

**Pathways:** Account for a service's energy or water; follow a supply from source to use; investigate reliability and upkeep. Begin with relevant quantities and balances; operating, designing, and manufacturing utility equipment remain separate goals.

**Available:** [Water, sanitation and industrial utilities](../ergon/hephaestus/utilities/water-and-sanitation/Water-sanitation-and-industrial-utilities.lingua#r_7B9GRCJFHVBEEQEXKWCR2QMMPN) develops from ordinary quantities and service questions through sources, treatment, distribution, wastewater, residuals, industrial reuse and continuing operation. Complete books and public courses, six original calculations, comparative system studies and independent research provide increasing depth. Thirteen shared learning Records retain their other continuations; advanced drinking-water, wastewater and industrial studies branch and meet again at uncertainty and research.

**Available:** [Industrial gases, vacuum and high-purity supplies](../ergon/hephaestus/utilities/industrial-gases-vacuum-and-high-purity-supplies/Industrial-gases-and-vacuum.lingua#r_3GHQJEYMYEN6JDKSF4PPJ403RF) develops from everyday service and shared quantities through production/separation, molecular transport, pumps, surfaces, storage, delivery and measurement. Operation, failure investigation, reliability, commissioning, maintenance, energy and recovery lead into nineteen advanced investigations, integrated clean-process/cryogenic/compressed-air systems and independent research. Complete books, courses and primary methods support 265 connected learning Records, including forty-one reused steps, with thirty-five source Records. Publication checks preserve the selected route, shared routes, source references and original calculations after export and relocation.

## Planned pathways

- [Electricity infrastructure and energy storage](Trails.lingua#r_5WDHZ2EBHAKP6Y0H4DABH0MC5H)
