Production and quality (@plan-production-and-quality: 0, is #chapter, #planned, #part-of @plan-hephaestus, #contains @plan-standards-interoperability-and-quality-infrastructure, #contains @plan-clean-manufacturing-and-contamination-control, #contains @plan-food-production-preservation-and-distribution-systems, #contains @plan-industrial-ecology-and-lifecycle-assessment, #related "../ergon/hephaestus/production/Production.lingua#r_2Y7YR9YHGPS7CWXQ7R4SAJVBR4") { r_3YPJC2P8KN1G137NF9WXVQACRZ
