Clean manufacturing and contamination control (@plan-clean-manufacturing-and-contamination-control: 0, is #chapter, #planned, #part-of @plan-production-and-quality, #related "../ergon/hephaestus/production/clean-manufacturing-and-contamination-control/Clean-manufacturing-and-contamination-control.lingua#r_7D8SQ8BVQDZQBDBGC6DP0JAMZN") { r_47NQ213DRJK1AMKQX7DTXR8E6X
**Editorial reference:** ERG-181.

**TODO — sensitive data:** Specialist microbial laboratory methods are deferred after the user reported a stop during research involving sensitive biological source material. Their role in contamination control remains in scope; further coverage must stay within safe scientific context, interpretation and concise caution. Skip this portion for now and continue with specialist manufacturing and continuing operation.

Clean manufacturing controls particles, chemical contamination, biological contamination, and environmental conditions according to process needs. This material connects cleanrooms, airflow, filtration, garments, handling, materials, monitoring, cleaning, and qualification with the facilities and practices supporting microelectronics, precision manufacture, pharmaceuticals, and research.

**Planning context:** [Production and quality](Trails.lingua#r_3YPJC2P8KN1G137NF9WXVQACRZ).
**Current draft:** [Clean manufacturing and contamination control — from familiar objects to controlled processes](../ergon/hephaestus/production/clean-manufacturing-and-contamination-control/Clean-manufacturing-and-contamination-control.lingua#r_7D8SQ8BVQDZQBDBGC6DP0JAMZN) contains 268 authored learning steps plus its entrance, twenty-six source Records and sixty-six reused foundations. The 335-Record learning route develops quantities, sampling, biological foundations, particle transport, surfaces, chemistry and cleaning, facility systems, aerosol and surface measurement, qualification and monitoring. Independently checked models and an original settling/diffusion calculation support twenty-four investigations. Continuing operation, specialist manufacturing and final research remain in development. Specialist microbial laboratory methods remain a deferred sensitive-data TODO.

## Development handoff — 30 October 2026

Continue from [Review what qualification and monitoring have established](../ergon/hephaestus/production/clean-manufacturing-and-contamination-control/studies/Review-what-qualification-and-monitoring-have-established.lingua#r_45F6FDPJHZ5MG7Y0K55BMA3H0X), `@cm-qualification-review`. This is the current final learning Record. Preserve the developed entrance identity `r_7D8SQ8BVQDZQBDBGC6DP0JAMZN`; this planning Record has its own identity and remains unfinished.

The latest extension added thirty-three learning Records, four reused foundations and three investigations. The subject has 296 own files: 269 learning Records including the entrance, twenty-six sources and an index. Verification passed 118 numerical comparisons, exact 335-Record selection and directed reachability, preservation of reused content and routes, and discovery of the same 3,046 documents from seventeen entrances. Sources remain outside the learning selection. Hephaestus and this register parse; the earlier parser delay is resolved. Full runtime export, relocation and reopening validation for this unfinished subject is still pending.

Continue in this order:

1. Develop semiconductor and precision-manufacturing cases, then optical or space-hardware cases. Connect contamination sources, contact materials, process steps, utilities, measurement and qualification to useful yield or performance. Begin with the existing [source collection](../ergon/hephaestus/production/clean-manufacturing-and-contamination-control/Sources.lingua#r_3AA0Q34WMJ3580S9QP4CZ24AG0), particularly the NASA contamination-engineering report and semiconductor-cleaning proceedings, and the shared materials, gas and metrology Records. Inspect focused primary research before adding advanced explanations of critical-area/yield models, defect clustering, optical scatter or absorption, films, deposition and preservation. Distinguish inspected passages from assigned reading and actual experimental reproduction from checked teaching models.
2. Complete the remaining specialist process comparisons, including safe systems-level treatment of pharmaceutical production and another relevant controlled process. Integrate the earlier chemical, surface, facility and qualification investigations into complete production accounts. Keep the microbial-method TODO deferred. Deepen thermophoretic, acoustic, optical and coupled surface-force models where relevant and supported; their introductory mentions do not yet provide a complete quantitative treatment.
3. Develop continuing operation: intervention, deviation investigation, restoration after change, maintenance and service access, packaging, storage and transport, people and knowledge transfer, utilities, energy, waste and lifecycle tradeoffs. Follow how useful performance is maintained across organizations and over time.
4. Finish the advanced investigations and research progression. Assign substantial foundational readings and precise specialist passages, independently check worked calculations, reconstruct a bounded published result, compare competing explanations, design an informative study and require a defensible independent contribution. Preserve the limits of available data and the agreed safety boundaries.
5. Add and run the subject's publication integration test using the existing patterns in [the Ergon publication tests](../../../crates/resources/tests/ergon.rs). Verify exact learning membership and reachability, discovery from several entries, distinct continuations of reused Records, source exclusion, and preservation of source URLs, local references and the original particle-column program through export, relocation and fresh-library reopening. Run the relevant Cargo check and Lingua checks. Keep unfinished portions explicitly recorded; retire this planning leaf and its pending inventory entry only when its completion requirements are satisfied. Then continue the remaining Hephaestus subjects.

Preserve the existing architecture while extending the content: ordinary Records, `#clean-manufacturing` outgoing assertions, references and discovery imports. New learning files import the developed entrance; the entrance discovers the new files and any required shared Records. Reused Records keep their original content, imports and other routes, adding only the new continuation. An ordinary source or contextual reference must not expand the selected learning route. Keep books, articles and other external source media outside the repository.

The [development ledger](../../anicca/Ergon.md) holds the detailed verification and source history. Useful local artifacts, if still present, are `/tmp/clean-qualification-publication.json`, `/tmp/clean-qualification-audit-result.json`, `/tmp/clean-qualification-numerics.json`, `/tmp/audit-clean-qualification.py` and `/tmp/check-clean-qualification.py`. The qualification draft generator and publisher have already run; do not rerun them over authored files. The repository Records are authoritative, and continuation must remain possible if temporary artifacts are gone. Recheck the worktree and applicable instructions before changing it; preserve unrelated work.

} r_47NQ213DRJK1AMKQX7DTXR8E6X

