Earth and environment (@plan-earth-and-environment: 0, is #chapter, #planned, #part-of @plan-gaia, #contains @plan-geophysics, #contains @plan-geochemistry, #contains @plan-paleontology-and-earth-history, #contains @plan-meteorology-and-atmospheric-science, #contains @plan-climate-science, #contains @plan-ocean-and-cryosphere-sciences, #contains @plan-hydrology-and-water-science, #contains @plan-soil-science, #contains @plan-environmental-systems-science, #contains @plan-geodesy-and-surveying, #contains @plan-remote-sensing-and-earth-observation, #contains @plan-natural-hazards-and-disaster-science) { r_3Z6AXZ9Z4Y0AT6PZSZRWTPD6QE
**Existing entrance:** [Earth](../ergon/gaia/earth/Earth.lingua).

[Earth — materials, processes, and geological history](../ergon/gaia/earth/Earth.lingua#r_5H7Y6QD1FW4Z0JJ6C7SH4DDHXH) is the current entrance, connected through [Nature](../ergon/gaia/Nature.lingua#r_5DAMNRQZX9M2PRPHVJB673XX21), Ergon, Philosophy, and Ergon.

**Pathways:** Observe a landscape, water system, soil, or weather record; connect local observations to larger processes. Begin with the chosen observations, quantities, and map use; add the relevant chemistry, mechanics, statistics, or modelling with the selected investigation.

**Available:** [Geology](../ergon/gaia/earth/geology/Geology.lingua#r_3CK43VQS79NK0STWNPSCS8YM06), from observations, rocks, maps, and time through tectonics, deformation, surface/water systems, regional history, resources, and infrastructure. Complete books, university/laboratory studies, structural and chronological methods, original calculations, sustained field projects, and independent scholarship provide practical and academic depth. Five shared learning Records have distinct geology continuations.

**Available:** [Mineralogy and petrology](../ergon/gaia/earth/mineralogy-and-petrology/Mineralogy-and-petrology.lingua#r_44F7X6GPMW6ZSCCN6D71QSVKBN), from specimens and crystal chemistry through symmetry, mineral families, optical/analytical methods, phase relations, and advanced igneous/sedimentary/metamorphic investigation. Complete books and laboratory/course sequences lead to graduate cases, quantitative models, sustained practical projects, feedstock studies, and independent scholarship. Eight shared Records retain distinct continuations.

