Proposed branch Record: `@connected-systems-map`. Planning umbrella: `@plan-ergon`. Proposed content home: `institute/trails/ergon/connected-systems/`; reuse Hephaestus and Gaia Records by reference.

**Pathways:** Follow a declared chain such as minerals to microchips, or sources to a continuing library. Offer an orientation through its stages with optional depth into each branch; do not concatenate every participating field into one compulsory curriculum.

