From mineral resources to precision machinery (@plan-from-mineral-resources-to-precision-machinery: 0, is #chapter, #planned, #part-of @plan-connected-system-journeys) { r_49NHYC1TEA3GBH0X14JXAYRVQD
**Editorial reference:** ERG-191.

This route follows the dependencies connecting geological resources to machines capable of accurate manufacturing. It joins extraction, metallurgy, energy, machine tools, bearings, controls, metrology, skilled trades, and repair, identifying the initial equipment and external contributions needed to bootstrap a productive workshop.

**Planning context:** [Connected system journeys](Trails.lingua#r_130DJVF2VF7PTVA9NBR8B9VNJA).
} r_49NHYC1TEA3GBH0X14JXAYRVQD

From minerals to microchips (@plan-from-minerals-to-microchips: 0, is #chapter, #planned, #part-of @plan-connected-system-journeys) { r_1C0FKKNR6ZJ67E351AR07YQ4P8
**Editorial reference:** ERG-192.

This route follows semiconductor production from feedstocks and purified materials to designed, fabricated, packaged, and tested chips. It connects chemistry, crystals, devices, lithography, optics, vacuum, gases, water, design software, equipment suppliers, facilities, and specialist labour, keeping unavailable methods and external dependencies visible.

**Planning context:** [Connected system journeys](Trails.lingua#r_130DJVF2VF7PTVA9NBR8B9VNJA).
} r_1C0FKKNR6ZJ67E351AR07YQ4P8

From energy supply to connected computation (@plan-from-energy-supply-to-connected-computation: 0, is #chapter, #planned, #part-of @plan-connected-system-journeys) { r_0QBQ23Z0Q65M9P8E6E0KETT9JD
**Editorial reference:** ERG-193.

This route explains what is required to keep useful computing and communications available. It joins energy resources, generation, grids, storage, components, computers, networks, facilities, software, and maintenance, following dependencies from physical supply to the digital tools that support other Ergon work.

**Planning context:** [Connected system journeys](Trails.lingua#r_130DJVF2VF7PTVA9NBR8B9VNJA).
} r_0QBQ23Z0Q65M9P8E6E0KETT9JD

From water sources to a healthy community (@plan-from-water-sources-to-a-healthy-community: 0, is #chapter, #planned, #part-of @plan-connected-system-journeys) { r_18G1P0BNXYVA6B33KVMEEPGQ6E
**Editorial reference:** ERG-194.

This route connects water, sanitation, environmental conditions, food, health evidence, and the institutions supporting a settlement. It joins natural systems with engineering, laboratories, maintenance, logistics, and professional knowledge, showing how several disciplines cooperate to sustain essential services over time.

**Planning context:** [Connected system journeys](Trails.lingua#r_130DJVF2VF7PTVA9NBR8B9VNJA).
} r_18G1P0BNXYVA6B33KVMEEPGQ6E

From soil to food and nutrient cycles (@plan-from-soil-to-food-and-nutrient-cycles: 0, is #chapter, #planned, #part-of @plan-connected-system-journeys) { r_0G5VH1SR5GHQ7N4JHDZQ1WAZZ3
**Editorial reference:** ERG-195.

This route follows the relationships between land, soil, water, organisms, agricultural work, processing, consumption, and returned nutrients. It connects chemistry, ecology, farming, machinery, energy, logistics, nutrition, and material recovery, including the measurements and recurring tasks that preserve productive capacity.

**Planning context:** [Connected system journeys](Trails.lingua#r_130DJVF2VF7PTVA9NBR8B9VNJA).
} r_0G5VH1SR5GHQ7N4JHDZQ1WAZZ3

From basic materials to buildings and transport (@plan-from-basic-materials-to-buildings-and-transport: 0, is #chapter, #planned, #part-of @plan-connected-system-journeys) { r_5JF7HZ7KERQ7YH7KWFVRZQ8CDD
**Editorial reference:** ERG-196.

This route follows the production systems behind usable places and connections between them. It joins minerals, metals, cement, glass, polymers, timber, construction equipment, vehicles, roads, railways, ports, utilities, inspection, and renewal, making the infrastructure of collective technical work visible.

**Planning context:** [Connected system journeys](Trails.lingua#r_130DJVF2VF7PTVA9NBR8B9VNJA).
} r_5JF7HZ7KERQ7YH7KWFVRZQ8CDD

From scientific discovery to manufactured application (@plan-from-scientific-discovery-to-manufactured-application: 0, is #chapter, #planned, #part-of @plan-connected-system-journeys) { r_408WW3M6RZXG3ZGD0XWN19CSZR
**Editorial reference:** ERG-197.

This route follows an idea through evidence, reproduction, design, scale-up, qualification, and production. It connects research methods, instruments, materials, engineering, pilot facilities, supply chains, testing, documentation, and feedback, explaining why a demonstrated phenomenon and a maintained useful product require different bodies of work.

**Planning context:** [Connected system journeys](Trails.lingua#r_130DJVF2VF7PTVA9NBR8B9VNJA).
} r_408WW3M6RZXG3ZGD0XWN19CSZR

From learner to a continuing skilled workforce (@plan-from-learner-to-a-continuing-skilled-workforce: 0, is #chapter, #planned, #part-of @plan-connected-system-journeys) { r_5TNAFAKGJD0K7WNZM4QTKN8JZ2
**Editorial reference:** ERG-198.

This route investigates how a community reproduces its capacity to investigate, build, operate, and maintain complex systems. It connects foundational education, specialised study, apprenticeship, practice, assessment, teaching, technical documentation, and succession, linking individual understanding to the continued availability of skilled work.

**Planning context:** [Connected system journeys](Trails.lingua#r_130DJVF2VF7PTVA9NBR8B9VNJA).
} r_5TNAFAKGJD0K7WNZM4QTKN8JZ2

From scattered sources to a joined Ergon library (@plan-from-scattered-sources-to-a-joined-ergon-library: 0, is #chapter, #planned, #part-of @plan-connected-system-journeys) { r_0V8CJ3F1M8DXCQJ7PAW1M4DDM4
**Editorial reference:** ERG-199.

This route organises the work of connecting existing knowledge into a usable whole. It joins subject mapping, source selection, passage references, concise explanations, translation, authored learning routes, updates, and preservation, using ordinary Lince features to connect Institute, external, and personally retained material.

**Planning context:** [Connected system journeys](Trails.lingua#r_130DJVF2VF7PTVA9NBR8B9VNJA).
} r_0V8CJ3F1M8DXCQJ7PAW1M4DDM4

Sustaining a regional Ergon ecosystem (@plan-sustaining-a-regional-ergon-ecosystem: 0, is #chapter, #planned, #part-of @plan-connected-system-journeys) { r_5DFZK87VBPQ1HWYR6RSY1YPHG3
**Editorial reference:** ERG-200.

This route brings together the people, knowledge, facilities, resources, services, and agreements needed to sustain advanced technical activity in a region. It connects education, research, production, utilities, logistics, maintenance, governance, and Transfers, treating outside dependencies and cooperation between specialised communities as explicit parts of the system.

**Planning context:** [Connected system journeys](Trails.lingua#r_130DJVF2VF7PTVA9NBR8B9VNJA).
} r_5DFZK87VBPQ1HWYR6RSY1YPHG3

Scholazein — pursuits of a well-spent life (@plan-scholazein: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @trails, #contains @plan-philosophical-study, #contains @plan-history, #contains @plan-sociology, #contains @plan-ethics-and-responsibility, #contains @plan-political-economy, #contains @plan-literature, #contains @plan-geography-and-communities, #related "../scholazein/Scholazein.lingua#r_E8E2D1B2D2994E0AD5F5D002D6") { r_F0C67572595D006B38030FA375
