**Content home:** `institute/trails/scholazein/`.

Philosophy, its traditions, history, sociology, political-economy, literature, and art belong here. Studying work, power, and distribution connects to Ergon without reducing social inquiry to production. Use [Philosophy](../scholazein/philosophy/Philosophy.lingua) as an existing entrance; retain the art directory alongside it.

