Proposed branch Record: `@geography-communities-map`. Organising Record: `@society-map`.

**Pathways:** Explain how location, movement, settlement, and scale shape a question; read and critique a map of people and infrastructure. Introduce coordinates and spatial data when used, and connect to Earth systems without requiring geodesy or GIS programming before every geographical question.

