- [Keep reliable stock and follow replenishment](Trails.lingua#r_1MJBA7PJ18G9S866H2E7W2NM4B)
- [Construct and explain a mathematical proof](Trails.lingua#r_2J4VJND0TG71WF59MMSQKH08JW)
- [Observe and explain a local living environment](Trails.lingua#r_0BXCDBNZD20KZQQZ7FM1JZT2Y3)
- [Understand, build, and maintain a low-voltage instrument](Trails.lingua#r_6HP73HYF8KR5641QDQY1TVM0YC)
- [Investigate a historical change](Trails.lingua#r_1GP5K0FT8V18QN96V80XDSBVEY)
- [Explain work, power, and distribution](Trails.lingua#r_7QFBK4BWX85SFZSPDS3J7MVA24)
- [Interpret a population-health comparison](Trails.lingua#r_3Y92CA9RE44CKFM1ME82CR2WG0)

**Planning context:** [Trails — Knowledge to learn and use](Trails.lingua#r_7A4AY51TXG87NVHR9J1XNZTJQ9).
